      "writtenOn": "2018-02-28T19:24:43Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Methods 1 and 5 are the official methods defined in the ISO/IEC 14443-4 specification. The others are proprietary and not recommended because they may alter tag state. Ruchi if we don\u0027t have any devices using the proprietary methods, perhaps we should just remove those.",
      "parentUuid": "bbc180dc_8063802f",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 48,
        "startChar": 4,
